{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"The color of the background outside the view finders outline. Use this color to mask the region","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that is not of interest.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Defaults to a black color with an opacity of 0.66, slightly darkening the non-interest area of the screen."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration\/backgroundColor","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration\/backgroundcolor"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration\/backgroundcolor"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"backgroundColor","externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration(py)backgroundColor","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"backgroundColor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UIColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIColor"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"backgroundColor"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"backgroundColor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UIColor"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The view finder configuration object for a ‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and its subclasses."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Sometimes it is necessary to limit a live video frame detection or recognition to a certain rectangular area with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a specific aspect ratio: the region or rectangle of interest. This is where a view finder comes in."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It crops the video frame to that region of interest before passing it to any detector or recognizer. Usually"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the performance of detectors\/recognizers gain a benefit from it because less pixels must be processed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Additionally, to guide the user, the view finder visualizes the region of interest by drawing a rectangle around","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the user interface.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration/backgroundColor":{"title":"backgroundColor","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"backgroundColor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIColor","text":"UIColor"}],"navigatorTitle"